                <div slot="icon">
                    <svg width="64" height="64" viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                        <path d="M42.6666 5.33331V16M21.3333 5.33331V16" stroke="#6C6B75" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                        <path d="M34.6667 10.6667H29.3333C19.2767 10.6667 14.2484 10.6667 11.1242 13.7909C8 16.9151 8 21.9434 8 32V37.3334C8 47.3899 8 52.4184 11.1242 55.5424C14.2484 58.6667 19.2767 58.6667 29.3333 58.6667H34.6667C44.7232 58.6667 49.7517 58.6667 52.8757 55.5424C56 52.4184 56 47.3899 56 37.3334V32C56 21.9434 56 16.9151 52.8757 13.7909C49.7517 10.6667 44.7232 10.6667 34.6667 10.6667Z" stroke="#6C6B75" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                        <path d="M8 26.6667H56" stroke="#6C6B75" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                        <path d="M29.3333 37.3333H42.6666M21.3333 37.3333H21.3572M34.6666 48H21.3333M42.6666 48H42.6426" stroke="#6C6B75" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <p slot="description" class="text-base leading-relaxed">
                    <strong>Planifica tus comidas, ahorra dinero</strong> y tiempo en tu día a día. Conoce recetas que reutilizan ingredientes, se adaptan a tu <strong>nutrición y tu bolsillo.</strong>
                </p>
            </FeatureCard>
            <FeatureCard title="IA Nutricional Predictiva">
                <div slot="icon">
                    <svg width="64" height="64" viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
